      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Streaming ingestion \u2014 pharmacy & e-commerce sales events \u2192 ingestion API \u2192 Postgres staging\nThe producer replays each refresh's sales as a live stream (micro-batches of 50 events, target 400 events/s). **Latency** = DB commit time \u2212 event creation time. Malformed events are counted in the API's validation try/except and written to `rejects.rejected_rows`. *Set the time range to cover the refresh runs.*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Events ingested",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "sdi-postgres"
      },
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
